    },
    "dialogue:ep101-map-quiz-1:en": {
      "text": "That night Wukong turned into a bee and flew out of the jail and to Squire Kou's house.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/39541116e59d.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n045"
    },
    "dialogue:ep101-map-quiz-1:zh": {
      "text": "那晚,悟空化作一只蜜蜂,飞出牢房,直奔寇员外家而去。",
